P95,noted,"noted -- the third segment of the strip, a LinearGradient of (0.8, 0.3, 0.25) to itself, reads 216 104 88 on iOS where Android and macOS read the swatch colour (colour_bbox --sample; the plain swatch is 200 72 72 in its 8-step bins on all three). UIKitBackend draws the gradient in a different colour space (queue.md item 20). The rest matches; the Android 1-px seam is item 19.",img/ios-p95.jpg?v=20261016-030014,402 × 874 pt · 20261016-030014,img/android-p95.jpg?v=20261016-012535,411 dp wide · 20261016-012535
